<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>If I’d have Christ formed within me,</l><l>I must breathe my final breath,</l><l>Live within the Cross’s shadow,</l><l>Put my soul-life e’er to death.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>If God thru th’ Eternal Spirit</l><l>Nail me ever with the Lord;</l><l>Only then as death is working</l><l>Will His life thru me be poured.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
